{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"relation\": \"正在面对\",\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S07-1\",\n      \"text\": \"他开始常常惦念对方，也想把喜欢留在心里，免得对方为难，也怕被期待牵着走。\",\n      \"key\": \"留在心里\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\n        \"B1\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S07-2\",\n      \"text\": \"可他还是盼自己的关心能被对方领会。\",\n      \"key\": \"对方领会\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\n        \"B1\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S07-3\",\n      \"text\": \"他一直没催对方，只能自己带着想被回应的期待。\",\n      \"key\": \"自己带着\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"explains\": [\n        \"B1\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S07-4\",\n      \"text\": \"他舍不得为了少惦记回应，就把喜欢压下去。\",\n      \"key\": \"喜欢压下\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\n        \"B2\"\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"id\": \"S07-5\",\n      \"text\": \"他开始在意眼前的亲近还能留多久。\",\n      \"key\": \"还能留多久\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"explains\": [\n        \"B3\"\n      ]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"because\": [\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-1\",\n      \"rel\": \"改写\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S06-3\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-4\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S03-1\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-5\",\n      \"rel\": \"提供理由\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"from\": \"S02-2\",\n      \"to\": \"S07-5\",\n      \"rel\": \"仍在起作用\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"changes\": [\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\n        \"R28\",\n        \"R29\"\n      ],\n      \"now\": [\n        \"S07-1\"\n      ],\n      \"what\": \"合并改写\",\n      \"why\": \"把不再轻巧、难收放的抽象概括改成常常惦念的具体变化，同时保留他想把喜欢留在心里、怕让对方为难和怕被期待牵着走的打算。由S06-3说明这份私下的甜如何变成更多心思。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\n        \"R30\"\n      ],\n      \"now\": [\n        \"S07-2\"\n      ],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"保留盼自己的关心被领会这一独立愿望，让它与前面的私下克制形成冲突，不再用越来越深之类的概括代替具体的渴望。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\n        \"R31\"\n      ],\n      \"now\": [\n        \"S07-3\"\n      ],\n      \"what\": \"精简\",\n      \"why\": \"删去与R29重复的怕给对方添负担的理由，留下他没有催促、仍盼回应、只能独自承受期待的代价。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [\n        \"R32\"\n      ],\n      \"now\": [\n        \"S07-4\"\n      ],\n      \"what\": \"改写\",\n      \"why\": \"删掉并非不值得这类抽象判断，改成他不愿为了少惦记回应而压下喜欢。将原因接回S06-3独自惦念时的甜，而不是只接到关心对方的行为。\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"v6\": [],\n      \"now\": [\n        \"S07-5\"\n      ],\n      \"what\": \"补充\",\n      \"why\": \"补上B3的时间感。先前已经盼着亲近长久，也知道日子一直向前走；如今这份亲近变得重要，他才开始在意眼前的相处还能持续多久。\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "59134d82-003b-406e-82e7-2ce057446dec", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261029T081008073808Z", "elapsed_seconds": 928.687, "completed_utc": "2026-10-29T08:25:36.775595+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "613923ad1b7f1c574ad66f7fcf2f7c7c42e6e13fc7643e043590e239e1882893", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f